\midrule
CS-01 & Red Sea / Houthi crisis           & B & 12 Jan 2024 & \texttt{\^{}CNXINFRA}  & Freight surcharges; FMCG export delays \\
CS-02 & US semiconductor export controls  & A & 29 Jan 2024 & \texttt{\^{}CNXIT}     & Downstream chip scarcity; auto/AI demand \\
CS-03 & Iran oil sanctions tightening     & A & 16 Feb 2024 & \texttt{\^{}CNXENERGY} & Crude substitution premium; Brent spread \\
CS-04 & China rare-earth export curbs     & C & 01 Feb 2024 & \texttt{\^{}CNXMETAL}  & EV battery / specialty steel input costs \\
CS-05 & Russia Black Sea energy disruption & B & 18 Jan 2024 & \texttt{\^{}CNXENERGY} & Russian crude freight premium (+54\%) \\
