\subsection{Case 2: Semiconductor export controls}

\paragraph{Linkage and retrieval.} The exact-source join linked seven coded event records to one same-day GKG row carrying the article URL. In a same-day corpus of 120{,}718 metadata rows, the exact article ranked 4{,}033rd under the baseline TF-IDF query (cosine score 0.0692). Enriching the query moved it to rank 55, still outside the top 50 (Table~\ref{tab:semi-rank}). A single-rater review of the baseline top 20 classified 12 items as unrelated and eight as adjacent context; none was directly relevant under the case-specific rubric, giving direct-relevance precision@20 of 0.0 for this diagnostic sample. Because the review relied largely on titles, URL slugs, and metadata, it should be read as a small diagnostic, not a general precision estimate.

