\paragraph{Market context.} All case estimates used 120 pre-event trading sessions (Table~\ref{tab:semi-car}, Figure~\ref{fig:semi-car}). These series were not selected by GeoSignal, and the article did not enter the top 50 lexical candidates after query enrichment. The calculations therefore show market context for analyst-selected proxies, not that the pipeline identified exposed firms or that the report caused the observed returns.

